      <div class="step r" style="--d:.35s">
        <div class="num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6c0-1.7 3.6-3 8-3s8 1.3 8 3-3.6 3-8 3-8-1.3-8-3z"/><path d="M4 6v6c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V6M4 12v6c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3v-6"/></svg></div>
        <div class="tag">02 · PULL</div><h3>AI pulls live data</h3>
        <p>Straight from the source, no manual export.</p>
        <div class="src"><span>Meta Graph API</span><span>TikTok Ads</span><span>Shopee CPAS</span><span>Ads Library</span><span>Fathom</span></div>
